			"notes": "Rewrote from scratch for Fabric using Kotlin. Built for Minecraft 1.20.1 (Fabric Loader 0.14.21, Fabric API 0.83.0, Kotlin 1.8.22, Fabric Language Kotlin 1.9.5).\n\nAdds a `/bed` chat command that teleports players back to their bed (respawn point), and optionally charges experience based on distance. Defaults to 1 experience per 10 blocks, and free for under 50 blocks. Has a default activation delay of 5 seconds, and cooldown of 2 minutes."
		},
